t for a USCG Licensed captain to drive the boat for you. Per federal law we cannot select a captain for you, but would be happy to introduce you to a choice of local skippers who are qualified to operate the boat. The hired captain will be paid directly at the time of the rental and usually charge $50 per hour.\n\n##Need to know\n\n**NO Drugs, Hard Liquor, Red Wine, or Glass Containers allowed.  Please drink responsibly and be over 21 years old.  Rentals with overly intoxicated party members will be cancelled.  Drivers must refrain from any alcohol consumption\n**Renter's ID and matching payment credit card must be presented upon checkin. Must be 18+ to rent.\n**Max passenger capacity is 12.  This includes all children.\n**Onsite parking can be limited.  Please carpool if you can.  We have a parking lot and street parking available, but please allow ample time if you choose to drive. Arrive at least 30 mins early for check in.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Seaforth Boat Rental - Mission Bay, 1641 Quivira Road, San Diego, CA, 92109", "booking_notes": "##What to bring\nPhoto ID and credit card used for payment required for check in. Hired captains will charge $50/hour + gratuity, paid directly in cash to the captain that you have hired.\nFood & drinks are welcome on board. Please avoid red wine, hard liquor and glass bottles.  Drugs, including marijuana, are strictly prohibited. \n\n**WE LOVE YOUR CUTE HEELS BUT FOR YOUR SAFETY PLEASE WEAR FLAT SHOES FOR YOUR CHARTER!**", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Book Online or Call the Boat Rental Office at 619-223-1681", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/seaforthboatrental/items/437545/images/901169/", "pk": 901169, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/OoJ7yofxSK